<section class="section" style="padding-top:48px;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:900px;">
    <span class="eyebrow" data-i18n="organic.eyebrow">Organic Farming</span>
    <h1 data-i18n="organic.title">Practical Organic Farming for Africa</h1>
    <p class="lede" data-i18n="organic.intro">GoOrganicAfrica promotes practical, responsible organic farming across Africa — combining real farm experience, biological inputs, soil health, livestock care and farmer education.</p>

    <div class="section-head" style="text-align:left;margin:42px 0 24px;">
      <h2 data-i18n="organic.missionTitle">From the farm to African farmers</h2>
      <p class="lede" data-i18n="organic.missionBody">This section is where we document the organic farming approach behind GoOrganicAfrica and introduce products developed or used through that work.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="category-grid">
      <article class="category-card">
        <h3 data-i18n="organic.inoculumTitle">InoculumPlus</h3>
        <p data-i18n="organic.inoculumBody">A mycorrhiza-fungi-based biofertilizer for supporting beneficial relationships between plant roots and soil fungi. Product information, application guidance and field experience can be added here.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="category-card">
        <h3 data-i18n="organic.organicGrowTitle">OrganicGrow</h3>
        <p data-i18n="organic.organicGrowBody">An organic farming solution presented for poultry, fish and other livestock. Farmers can learn about its intended uses, application guidance and practical experience.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="category-card">
        <h3 data-i18n="organic.nutrientsTitle">Organic Calcium, Phosphorus, Potassium &amp; Sulfur</h3>
        <p data-i18n="organic.nutrientsBody">Organic nutrient solutions for crop production and soil fertility management. Each product can have its own detailed guide, dosage information and demonstration.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="section" style="padding:52px 0 20px;">
